# Unity Project Foundation

Status: DONE
Milestone: M1 Technical proofs
Dependencies: `15_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo`

## Purpose

Create a reproducible Unity repository that opens, tests, and builds cleanly before gameplay systems expand.

## Tasks

- [x] Confirm Unity editor version and record it: `2022.3.47f1`.
- [x] Confirm URP as the rendering pipeline. URP `14.0.11` is installed and active.
- [x] Create the Unity project at `EntropyTag/`.
- [x] Apply Unity `.gitignore` and verify Library, Temp, Logs, UserSettings, and generated solution are ignored.
- [x] Install Input System `1.7.0` and activate **Input System Package (New)**.
- [x] Set Company Name to `ZanarksDevDesk` and verify that Unity serializes it.
- [x] Create `Assets/EntropyTag/` folder structure from `docs/03_UNITY_PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`.
- [x] Create Domain, Application, Unity, Presentation, Infrastructure, Editor, EditMode, and PlayMode assemblies.
- [x] Create Bootstrap and initial test scenes.
- [x] Install only approved packages and remove unused Unity Version Control and Visual Scripting packages.
- [x] Create Input System action asset.
- [x] Add project-wide `.editorconfig`; defer external analyzers until a measured need justifies another package.
- [x] Add sample EditMode and PlayMode tests.
- [x] Add command-line test and development-build scripts.
- [x] Validate clean-clone setup.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Project opens without missing-package or serialization errors.
- [x] Assembly dependency direction matches the architecture document.
- [x] EditMode and PlayMode sample tests pass.
- [x] Development build launches.
- [x] Clean Git status contains no Unity-generated cache.
- [x] Setup steps are documented.

